WEBVTT

00:00.660 --> 00:05.980
<b>The Hidden Boss Battles the Demon Lord</b>

00:07.960 --> 00:09.860
<i>With the return of the Demon Lord,</i>

00:09.860 --> 00:13.810
<i>an army of monsters is advancing 
on the Kingdom of Valschein.</i>

00:14.710 --> 00:16.520
<i>Heading out to intercept them</i>

00:16.520 --> 00:21.220
<i>are an alliance of the kingdom's forces and 
the nobles, led by Captain Adolf, and...</i>

00:21.750 --> 00:25.250
<i>the students selected from the Royal Academy.</i>

00:28.900 --> 00:34.010
<i>We of the punitive force are heading for 
the Demon Lord's castle to slay him.</i>

00:35.080 --> 00:39.010
<i>I couldn't get there before due to 
the driving force of the game's plot,</i>

00:39.280 --> 00:40.940
<i>but it's going smoothly this time.</i>

00:42.310 --> 00:45.390
Please, just for today, wear 
the Amulet of Protection.

00:46.060 --> 00:47.650
I can't rest easy if you don't.

00:51.130 --> 00:52.070
Okay.

00:53.710 --> 00:55.460
You be careful, too.

01:02.050 --> 01:03.520
That's the Demon Lord's castle.

01:03.520 --> 01:05.080
Ryu, take us down.

01:31.290 --> 01:34.860
<b>Villainess Level 99</b>

01:31.670 --> 01:34.860
I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord

02:51.150 --> 02:53.900
Third platoon, stay back! 
I'll make an earth wall!

03:04.390 --> 03:06.450
A dragon! There's a dragon now!

03:06.450 --> 03:09.000
Don't falter! I'll go!

03:23.500 --> 03:25.890
Don't let your guard down! Resume the attack!

03:28.510 --> 03:31.140
<i>Yumiella, please be all right.</i>

03:35.450 --> 03:37.780
Well, we've finally come this far.

03:38.070 --> 03:40.940
Let's show him how much 
we've grown in two years.

03:41.610 --> 03:44.020
Alicia, you're our trump card.

03:44.020 --> 03:46.280
We'll be depending on your light magic.

03:47.300 --> 03:48.040
Right.

03:49.320 --> 03:53.290
So, Miss Alicia, who here 
do you like the most?

03:54.850 --> 03:56.710
Is this really the time for that?!

03:57.000 --> 03:58.840
I apologize.

03:59.420 --> 04:01.840
<i>I was just trying to ease 
everyone's nerves...</i>

04:01.840 --> 04:03.850
Now, let's go!

04:06.110 --> 04:08.350
Ryu, go to Patrick.

04:08.610 --> 04:10.580
You're technically a monster, too.

04:10.580 --> 04:14.260
If you stay here, you could fall 
under the Demon Lord's control.

04:44.150 --> 04:47.330
Miss Yumiella, thank you for 
all your help before.

04:47.330 --> 04:49.850
Huh? What brought that on?

04:50.220 --> 04:54.370
You've helped me out so much, but I 
hadn't found a chance to thank you.

04:55.420 --> 04:56.980
Let's do our best together.

04:57.320 --> 05:00.140
Oh... Sure. Good luck.

05:00.710 --> 05:02.990
<i>I really need her to do her best.</i>

05:03.300 --> 05:06.980
<i>At both defeating the Demon 
Lord and marrying Edwin.</i>

05:06.980 --> 05:08.990
<i>I'm planning to leave that all to you.</i>

05:10.200 --> 05:13.060
This place sure is creepy, though.

05:13.060 --> 05:16.550
How is there a castle in 
a place like this, anyway?

05:16.550 --> 05:20.250
This area used to be part 
of a rather large domain.

05:20.890 --> 05:24.260
No one has been able to enter 
it for a long time, though.

05:24.260 --> 05:25.480
A domain?

05:25.800 --> 05:29.140
You mean some noble used to live here?

05:29.430 --> 05:34.640
Yes, but bizarrely, there's no mention 
of them in the royal records.

05:35.660 --> 05:38.610
I've searched old manuscripts and 
records from all over the kingdom,

05:38.610 --> 05:42.200
hoping I could find some 
hints about the Demon Lord.

05:43.010 --> 05:45.780
Wait, so back when we first met...

05:46.170 --> 05:47.060
Yeah.

05:47.480 --> 05:50.520
I thought the Royal Academy, 
founded by the first king,

05:50.520 --> 05:53.890
might have some sort of hidden records.

05:55.880 --> 05:57.040
We're here.

05:57.460 --> 05:58.450
This is it.

06:22.250 --> 06:23.090
No!

06:23.090 --> 06:24.340
We fell for it!

06:24.340 --> 06:25.150
Ed!

06:25.440 --> 06:26.530
Alicia!

06:34.300 --> 06:36.660
Foolish humans.

06:39.580 --> 06:40.960
The Demon Lord...

06:43.340 --> 06:44.290
Ed!

06:44.290 --> 06:46.080
Don't worry about us!

06:46.080 --> 06:47.880
Just fight the Demon Lord!

06:49.220 --> 06:51.970
Prince Edwin, please stay behind me.

06:52.310 --> 06:55.980
Oh? This boy is royalty of Valschein, is he?

06:56.660 --> 06:58.730
Don't think your death will be painless.

06:58.730 --> 06:59.300
Ed!

06:59.300 --> 07:00.230
Be careful!

07:00.510 --> 07:02.380
Quiet, you little pests!

07:06.110 --> 07:07.310
Dark Flame!

07:12.330 --> 07:13.430
Oh?

07:16.940 --> 07:18.040
Holy Lance!

07:18.870 --> 07:21.710
Fourth-generation elemental 
magic: Composite Attack!

07:45.980 --> 07:48.110
Alicia! Will! Oz!

07:48.470 --> 07:53.740
<i>I guess their levels weren't high enough 
to fight the Demon Lord head-on.</i>

07:54.600 --> 07:56.240
<i>This throws off the plan.</i>

07:57.290 --> 08:00.520
<i>I can't let Alicia or the 
boys do anything dangerous.</i>

08:03.110 --> 08:04.330
Your name?

08:04.810 --> 08:06.630
Yumiella Dolkness.

08:07.540 --> 08:11.010
I'm impressed you were able to 
break my binding magic.

08:11.400 --> 08:13.970
And you appear to be of the 
dark attribute, as well.

08:15.170 --> 08:20.270
Why not abandon these silly 
humans and work with me?

08:20.570 --> 08:24.520
I decline. I have no reason 
to do such a thing.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.520
You defy me, then?

08:31.150 --> 08:32.820
This will happen to you, too.

08:34.460 --> 08:35.530
Alicia!

08:35.800 --> 08:36.780
Your Highness, don't!

08:36.780 --> 08:37.910
Shadow Lance.

08:49.960 --> 08:52.350
<i>I have to fight him. It's the only way.</i>

08:52.740 --> 08:55.290
<i>Defeating the Demon Lord is 
my top priority right now.</i>

08:55.930 --> 08:57.490
Dark Bind.

09:00.580 --> 09:01.520
Shadow Lance!

09:02.410 --> 09:03.640
Have you lost your mind?

09:06.040 --> 09:07.690
I assumed you'd do that.

09:07.690 --> 09:08.790
What?!

09:11.000 --> 09:12.900
<i>Since Alicia's attribute is light,</i>

09:12.900 --> 09:15.000
<i>she has a resistance to dark magic.</i>

09:15.000 --> 09:16.030
Dark Bind.

09:16.680 --> 09:19.660
<i>I knew she'd take no damage as 
long as I restrained my power.</i>

09:35.350 --> 09:38.340
Your strength is on a different 
level than all the others.

09:39.260 --> 09:43.220
How about it? Change your 
mind and take my side?

09:43.220 --> 09:45.230
I told you, I will not.

09:45.450 --> 09:47.150
Your hair color...

09:47.590 --> 09:51.110
You may have some connection 
to the former, human me.

09:51.390 --> 09:54.860
Is he saying he used to be a human?

09:55.620 --> 09:58.660
What story do they tell about 
how this nation came to be?

09:58.660 --> 10:02.490
The hero and the saint defeated the 
Demon Lord and built the kingdom.

10:04.100 --> 10:06.160
The hero and the saint, eh?

10:06.160 --> 10:07.750
Those two boors?

10:08.010 --> 10:09.140
Boors?

10:09.900 --> 10:12.650
Before the formation of 
the Kingdom of Valschein,

10:12.650 --> 10:15.770
these lands were embroiled in an age of war,

10:15.770 --> 10:19.130
but your first king unified 
them and built a new nation.

10:19.460 --> 10:22.640
And I was his closest aide.

10:24.150 --> 10:26.430
I devoted my utmost loyalty to my king,

10:27.000 --> 10:31.650
but he feared my power and sent me 
out here to the middle of nowhere.

10:31.900 --> 10:36.650
No... my power was the only 
thing he really wanted.

10:37.500 --> 10:42.660
Not only that, but he branded me 
a traitor and tried to kill me.

10:43.380 --> 10:47.300
My rage and hatred turned 
me into the Demon Lord.

10:47.660 --> 10:52.670
And then I launched my counterattack 
in order to destroy the human world.

10:53.670 --> 10:56.120
The battle raged on for quite a long time,

10:56.120 --> 10:59.680
but in the end, they sealed me with 
the secret arts of ancient times.

11:01.160 --> 11:04.510
I continued to burn with rage 
and hatred toward the humans

11:04.990 --> 11:07.770
as I waited for the seal to break.

11:09.010 --> 11:11.520
So that's why there were no records?

11:11.520 --> 11:16.470
<i>Since I played the game,
I actually knew that whole story.</i>

11:18.010 --> 11:22.530
I believe the first king was entirely 
to blame for what happened back then.

11:22.530 --> 11:24.890
But things are different now.

11:25.330 --> 11:28.540
People are ostracized and envied 
because of their strength.

11:29.380 --> 11:31.610
I've even heard that black 
hair was first regarded

11:32.020 --> 11:35.510
as a bad omen while I was battling the king.

11:36.520 --> 11:39.550
Because my hair, as you can see, is black.

11:40.190 --> 11:43.990
Humans are still foolish, no matter the age.

11:44.680 --> 11:46.560
You must realize this yourself.

11:47.800 --> 11:49.810
I can't say you're wrong,

11:49.810 --> 11:55.310
but the current king and queen accepted 
me from the moment they met me.

11:55.670 --> 11:57.250
I've even made friends.

11:57.670 --> 12:00.320
And I have no intention of forsaking them.

12:00.870 --> 12:03.090
Human hearts change.

12:03.580 --> 12:08.080
What if the people you're 
protecting betray you one day?

12:09.510 --> 12:11.010
I think I'd run away.

12:11.750 --> 12:15.710
If that would bring them 
happiness, I'd accept it.

12:17.490 --> 12:19.590
Why don't you run away? There's still time.

12:20.220 --> 12:23.590
Go somewhere far away, and let 
everyone think you're dead.

12:23.820 --> 12:28.710
That may work just as well, 
but it's no longer an option.

12:31.640 --> 12:34.980
Because I have lived for such a long time

12:35.650 --> 12:39.480
so that I could see my 
hatred through to the end!

12:40.300 --> 12:43.670
I understand. It seems we must fight, then.

12:45.030 --> 12:47.580
Die, humans!

12:48.100 --> 12:52.250
I will bury all of you in darkness along 
with this boy of Valschein's royal blood!

12:53.290 --> 12:55.070
Black Hole!

12:56.540 --> 12:58.610
Black Hole!

13:03.160 --> 13:04.220
Now I have no choice.

13:23.150 --> 13:25.760
Don't make that face.

13:25.760 --> 13:28.160
This is what I wanted.

13:31.060 --> 13:32.460
Holy Shield!

13:35.370 --> 13:37.120
Miss Yumiella, hurry!

13:37.350 --> 13:40.590
Miss Alicia? You really are the heroine.

13:59.830 --> 14:01.540
We... won, right?

14:01.990 --> 14:06.030
Yeah, though us guys didn't 
really do anything useful.

14:07.060 --> 14:08.870
Miss Yumiella Dolkness.

14:09.830 --> 14:11.270
Well done.

14:11.880 --> 14:14.540
The kingdom is saved, thanks to you.

14:14.780 --> 14:18.790
No, this victory belongs to all of us.

14:19.350 --> 14:21.740
I'm happy to hear you say that,

14:21.740 --> 14:24.300
but you're the one who actually 
defeated the Demon Lord.

14:24.300 --> 14:26.960
That's right. Don't be modest.

14:26.960 --> 14:29.800
Looks like a new saint is born.

14:31.060 --> 14:34.430
No, it was you who led us, Your Highness.

14:34.430 --> 14:36.560
And Miss Alicia fought bravely...

15:01.560 --> 15:02.790
Stop, Alicia!

15:02.790 --> 15:04.440
What are you doing, Alicia?!

15:04.440 --> 15:06.510
What in the world are you thinking?!

15:06.850 --> 15:10.300
Let me go. I have to kill her.

15:10.300 --> 15:12.680
Why?! What is this all about?!

15:12.680 --> 15:14.540
I don't know, but...

15:14.540 --> 15:19.940
<i>Of course... The game's 
plot is driving Alicia</i>

15:19.940 --> 15:23.340
<i>to do things she would 
never do of her own will.</i>

15:24.820 --> 15:27.550
<i>In the game, after the 
Demon Lord is defeated,</i>

15:27.550 --> 15:31.200
<i>I show up as the hidden boss 
and get killed by Alicia.</i>

15:31.930 --> 15:33.860
<i>The defeat of the Demon Lord</i>

15:33.860 --> 15:37.460
<i>and the fact that I was 
standing right in front of her</i>

15:37.460 --> 15:39.370
<i>fulfilled the event conditions,</i>

15:39.370 --> 15:43.580
<i>leading Alicia to automatically recognize 
Yumiella Dolkness as an enemy</i>

15:43.580 --> 15:44.960
<i>and attack me.</i>

15:45.560 --> 15:47.240
<i>And with a light blade...</i>

15:47.570 --> 15:49.970
<i>If not for the Amulet of Protection, 
I'd have died instantly.</i>

15:50.770 --> 15:52.970
<i>Thank you, Patrick.</i>

15:53.340 --> 15:55.140
What's wrong with you, Alicia?!

15:55.620 --> 15:56.850
Let me go.

16:10.760 --> 16:12.000
Are you all right?

16:12.000 --> 16:15.320
Yes. The amulet saved me.

16:15.890 --> 16:20.950
Miss Alicia must have been cursed by the 
Demon Lord right before he disappeared.

16:20.950 --> 16:23.690
A curse! That explains it!

16:23.690 --> 16:25.710
That damned coward!

16:25.940 --> 16:27.930
<i>It's not really the truth,</i>

16:27.930 --> 16:30.340
<i>but I had to say it to smooth all this over.</i>

16:30.840 --> 16:34.180
<i>Sorry, Demon Lord, but I need
you to take the fall for this.</i>

16:36.060 --> 16:38.100
Alicia! Are you back to your senses?

16:38.770 --> 16:41.730
No... I can't control my...

16:42.000 --> 16:43.100
Alicia!

16:43.590 --> 16:47.360
My body... My body won't listen to me!

16:47.360 --> 16:49.390
Miss Yumiella, please run!

16:51.420 --> 16:54.850
<i>Can I afford to restrain my power right now?</i>

16:55.460 --> 16:59.370
<i>If I counter carelessly,
I could end up killing her.</i>

16:59.790 --> 17:00.910
<i>What do I do?</i>

17:05.060 --> 17:08.210
Prince Edwin, please stop Miss Alicia.

17:08.210 --> 17:09.340
Of course!

17:09.930 --> 17:11.590
Alicia!

17:11.590 --> 17:13.340
Hold her tighter!

17:13.890 --> 17:15.590
Stop this, Alicia!

17:17.610 --> 17:20.850
Alicia, if you must stab someone, stab me!

17:21.290 --> 17:24.850
Nice, Edwin! That's why you're the real hero!

17:25.380 --> 17:28.060
You two say something to her, too!

17:28.060 --> 17:30.300
Don't let the Demon Lord's curse beat you!

17:30.300 --> 17:31.860
Muster up all your strength!

17:32.530 --> 17:36.260
Miss Alicia, can you hear their voices?

17:36.260 --> 17:39.370
The voices of your friends, 
who care about you?

17:39.660 --> 17:41.080
You mustn't lose.

17:41.080 --> 17:44.980
Take back the power of love 
and friendship right now!

17:44.980 --> 17:46.620
Alicia! I...

17:47.010 --> 17:49.000
Alicia! I...

17:49.000 --> 17:51.420
Alicia! I love you!

17:57.350 --> 17:59.830
Have you awakened, my princess?

17:59.830 --> 18:02.330
Yes... I'm all right now.

18:02.710 --> 18:05.310
The love between you two and 
the friendship you all share

18:05.310 --> 18:07.940
broke the Demon Lord's curse.

18:07.940 --> 18:13.170
How wonderful. We must applaud the 
birth of the new hero and saint.

18:15.050 --> 18:20.020
<i>It looks like the prince's love was 
just the thing to awaken the heroine.</i>

18:21.240 --> 18:24.850
<i>But I really don't think 
I can fill that role.</i>

18:25.250 --> 18:26.870
<i>I don't want to, either.</i>

18:27.450 --> 18:30.460
<i>Looks like the game plot's 
driving force is gone now.</i>

18:31.020 --> 18:33.500
<i>I guess it's a happy ending.</i>

18:41.590 --> 18:45.510
We defeated the Demon Lord,
but it looks like he wants more.

18:45.510 --> 18:48.730
Fine by me! I'm in the 
mood to kick a little ass!

18:49.210 --> 18:51.080
Alicia, can you fight?

18:51.080 --> 18:52.690
Yeah, I'm fine!

18:57.130 --> 18:58.360
Let's go!

18:59.370 --> 19:03.370
Strike down the evil before me 
and bring justice to the land!

19:03.620 --> 19:07.790
Flames, burn this foe who 
brings disaster to ashes!

19:11.290 --> 19:13.560
We will not fail to protect...

19:13.560 --> 19:15.560
...this kingdom and its people!

19:19.550 --> 19:23.670
<i>William and Oswald get to take out 
their frustration at being rejected,</i>

19:23.670 --> 19:26.310
<i>while Edwin and Alicia 
use the power of love...</i>

19:26.590 --> 19:28.810
<i>They're all really letting loose.</i>

19:29.560 --> 19:33.010
<i>They probably want to make up for not 
doing much against the Demon Lord, too.</i>

19:35.190 --> 19:36.760
Uh, thanks...

19:37.560 --> 19:40.010
I'm sorry for what I did 
earlier, Miss Yumiella.

19:40.010 --> 19:41.320
Is your wound all right?

19:41.580 --> 19:43.650
Oh, uh...

19:43.650 --> 19:48.080
I mean, it'll probably take 
a while to fully heal.

19:48.500 --> 19:50.110
Don't worry!

19:50.110 --> 19:53.030
I'll fight hard enough for the both of us!

19:54.520 --> 19:55.660
Alicia!

19:56.060 --> 19:57.840
Ed, I'm coming!

19:58.230 --> 19:59.670
<i>That heroine smile...</i>

20:02.090 --> 20:06.740
<i>I'm actually pretty much fully 
healed, since I used a healing spell.</i>

20:07.100 --> 20:10.950
<i>So I could take out all these 
monsters if I wanted to, but...</i>

20:11.630 --> 20:14.630
<i>I'll give the boys a chance to shine.</i>

20:14.630 --> 20:16.730
<i>For the sake of a new legend.</i>

20:18.300 --> 20:19.730
Yumiella Punch.

20:27.830 --> 20:29.260
Over there, Ryu!

20:45.430 --> 20:47.010
Yumiella! Are you okay?!

20:47.690 --> 20:48.930
Patrick!

20:49.320 --> 20:50.370
And the Demon Lord?!

20:50.730 --> 20:55.290
It's okay. Things got a bit 
dicey, but we managed to win.

20:55.290 --> 20:57.660
All of us together, of course.

20:57.660 --> 20:59.240
I see! Thank goodness!

20:59.240 --> 21:02.070
Ashbatten, what about the army of monsters?

21:02.420 --> 21:04.090
We've taken out most of them.

21:04.700 --> 21:07.700
I'm here on Captain Adolf's orders.

21:07.700 --> 21:09.000
I see.

21:14.630 --> 21:16.290
Do you think this will be enough?

21:17.660 --> 21:19.430
Here's a potion for you.

21:19.430 --> 21:20.920
Oh... Thanks.

21:26.470 --> 21:27.680
Miss Yumiella!

21:28.350 --> 21:31.680
You're all right! I knew you would be!

21:31.680 --> 21:33.060
Thank you.

21:33.330 --> 21:35.930
I appreciate all your effort 
as well, Miss Eleonora.

21:37.690 --> 21:40.060
Brave men and women of 
the Kingdom of Valschein!

21:40.590 --> 21:44.030
We, the punitive force,
have defeated the Demon Lord!

21:46.540 --> 21:50.040
The danger is gone! We are victorious!

21:55.300 --> 21:57.830
Are you sure you shouldn't 
be up there with them?

21:59.130 --> 22:00.980
I'd rather be here.

22:10.430 --> 22:13.470
<i>And thus our battle against 
the Demon Lord came to an end.</i>

22:13.800 --> 22:16.850
<i>A lot of things happened 
that I didn't expect,</i>

22:16.850 --> 22:18.980
<i>but what's important is that we won.</i>

22:21.650 --> 22:24.810
<i>Edwin reported the details 
of the battle to the king.</i>

22:24.810 --> 22:31.620
<i>Alicia might not be entirely exempt 
from punishment for stabbing me,</i>

22:31.900 --> 22:35.900
<i>but I personally explained that 
she'd been cursed by the Demon Lord,</i>

22:35.900 --> 22:37.620
<i>so her penalty should be light.</i>

22:38.250 --> 22:40.620
<i>As for the granting of the 
titles of hero and saint...</i>

22:40.620 --> 22:42.630
<i>They're being put on hold for now.</i>

22:43.130 --> 22:47.130
<i>And I returned to my peaceful academy life.</i>

22:47.770 --> 22:52.110
<i>I spar with William and Oswald 
sometimes, per their request.</i>

22:52.890 --> 22:55.010
<i>One year remains until graduation.</i>

22:55.010 --> 22:58.790
<i>After that, I'll return to the 
Dolkness home and manage the domain.</i>

22:59.140 --> 23:02.560
<i>I'm sure that'll be a 
challenge in its own way,</i>

23:02.560 --> 23:06.480
<i>but I still have a little more time 
to just be a carefree student.</i>

23:06.930 --> 23:09.010
Where are we headed today, Yumiella?

23:09.010 --> 23:13.120
I found a dungeon to the north that 
I've never been in. We're going there.

23:13.120 --> 23:17.120
We're off school today,
and you still want to level up?

23:17.120 --> 23:22.250
I'm already level 99, but there are 
still rare items I haven't found.

23:22.720 --> 23:27.580
Besides, I want to help you 
get stronger. Is that wrong?

23:29.300 --> 23:32.300
Okay, I get it. Do whatever you want.

23:32.300 --> 23:33.260
Yay!

23:33.520 --> 23:35.110
Ryu, let's go!
